WEBVTT

00:00:02.700 --> 00:00:06.200
Koya, who suddenly appeared at
the Karasumori Site as an Ayakashi,

00:00:06.200 --> 00:00:11.160
lived and fought together
with Madarao 500 years ago.

00:00:12.640 --> 00:00:14.810
Due to the effects of Karasumori.
Koya transformed.

00:00:14.810 --> 00:00:20.080
Before Koya's attack, Yoshimori released
the forbidden seal placed on Madarao.

00:00:20.980 --> 00:00:25.250
The battle between Madarao and Koya,
now in their true forms, has begun!

00:00:31.460 --> 00:00:36.730
The dangerous forest invites me
It's showtime again tonight

00:00:36.730 --> 00:00:38.600
(Ayakashi NIGHT)

00:00:38.600 --> 00:00:43.810
Everyone's rampaging
with all their strength

00:00:43.810 --> 00:00:45.710
(Fighting late into the night)

00:00:46.210 --> 00:00:49.140
Drive away all hesitation

00:00:49.140 --> 00:00:53.550
Wanna take them on? Yeah

00:00:53.720 --> 00:00:57.090
I will protect you
(No matter what)

00:00:57.090 --> 00:01:00.420
I will protect you that's all
(that's all I want)

00:01:00.420 --> 00:01:06.090
Goodbye to the days
when all I'd do was cry

00:01:08.400 --> 00:01:10.590
Sha la la la la...

00:01:11.930 --> 00:01:17.010
I hold words in my heart
that I'd like to say

00:01:17.010 --> 00:01:18.970
(Secret romance)

00:01:18.970 --> 00:01:24.180
Standing in front of me is someone
I don't want to lose

00:01:24.180 --> 00:01:25.940
(A strange distance)

00:01:26.420 --> 00:01:32.790
I can't stand watching
people get hurt anymore

00:01:32.860 --> 00:01:33.860
Yeah

00:01:33.860 --> 00:01:37.330
I wanna be your knight
(I wanna be strong)

00:01:37.330 --> 00:01:40.930
I wanna be your light
(More than I am now)

00:01:40.930 --> 00:01:46.270
Someday I'll share with you
my 100% smile

00:02:06.690 --> 00:02:07.680
Madarao!

00:02:08.690 --> 00:02:09.780
I see.

00:02:10.090 --> 00:02:13.220
You hid your tail among the illusions.

00:02:13.730 --> 00:02:16.790
So it seems you learned how to fight dirty.

00:02:17.470 --> 00:02:20.870
But you're still no match for me.

00:02:22.070 --> 00:02:23.440
I win!

00:02:29.610 --> 00:02:31.310
I'm impressed, Koya.

00:02:32.050 --> 00:02:34.220
It took a while for it to take effect.

00:02:34.220 --> 00:02:36.080
W-What did you do to me?

00:02:37.790 --> 00:02:38.780
It's poison.

00:02:39.450 --> 00:02:43.120
With you, I needed to inject
a large dose...

00:02:43.860 --> 00:02:47.230
I had to make sure you didn't notice,
so I added some anesthetic too.

00:02:47.930 --> 00:02:48.920
It was back then.

00:02:58.510 --> 00:03:01.840
I am a demon poisoner
who can even stop the dead...

00:03:02.510 --> 00:03:06.780
Did you really think I did nothing
over these past 400 years?

00:03:07.320 --> 00:03:09.050
Why you...

00:03:09.280 --> 00:03:11.810
Go ahead.
Do what you want with me.

00:03:12.620 --> 00:03:14.520
I won't survive anyway.

00:03:14.890 --> 00:03:16.190
And neither will you.

00:03:16.260 --> 00:03:17.690
This will be the end for both of us.

00:03:17.730 --> 00:03:21.860
I... won't... die... Never!

00:03:26.500 --> 00:03:29.100
I wonder if this settles things
once and for all.

00:03:34.310 --> 00:03:35.670
Master Tokimori...

00:03:43.990 --> 00:03:45.040
It can't be...

00:03:45.890 --> 00:03:49.520
Is the power of Karasumori
going to help him?

00:03:49.560 --> 00:03:51.550
I... will... not... die...

00:03:52.390 --> 00:03:57.630
I can't die just... yet...

00:03:58.070 --> 00:04:00.530
But I'm... done for...

00:04:08.510 --> 00:04:09.670
You intend on dying?

00:04:10.810 --> 00:04:12.110
Be quiet.

00:04:12.610 --> 00:04:16.050
You promised me that
you'd listen to me.

00:04:18.750 --> 00:04:21.050
I said. I would think about it.

00:04:21.360 --> 00:04:22.850
Then promise me now.

00:04:23.190 --> 00:04:24.660
Promise what?

00:04:25.730 --> 00:04:28.360
That you'd better not die on me
and leave your master behind.

00:04:29.600 --> 00:04:32.260
You're calling yourself my master?
You little runt.

00:04:32.730 --> 00:04:35.570
Hurry up and get out of here.
This doesn't concern you.

00:04:35.900 --> 00:04:37.060
Yes. It does.

00:04:38.070 --> 00:04:40.470
You're making a mess in my yard.

00:04:41.410 --> 00:04:43.400
I won't let you have your way
with my yard.

00:04:43.680 --> 00:04:45.770
I won't let you die on me
without my permission either.

00:04:47.120 --> 00:04:48.170
No matter what.

00:04:49.180 --> 00:04:53.090
This boy... He isn't at
the level of Master Tokimori...

00:04:53.390 --> 00:04:55.150
But sometimes he sends
a chill down my spine.

00:04:56.060 --> 00:04:57.690
You've said it now.

00:04:58.830 --> 00:05:04.390
I guess it'll be a waste to leave
such a bratty kid behind.

00:05:05.630 --> 00:05:10.330
It seems that my master this time
around is a selfish brat.

00:05:13.510 --> 00:05:14.840
I'm sorry Koya.

00:05:15.610 --> 00:05:18.080
It seems that I can't die just yet.

00:05:18.410 --> 00:05:20.750
I am-!

00:05:23.950 --> 00:05:26.680
Ginro I want to go back
to the mountain.

00:05:27.920 --> 00:05:29.360
To our mountain...

00:05:29.860 --> 00:05:32.450
And we'll eat our fill of deer meat.

00:05:33.100 --> 00:05:37.050
After that your beautiful fur
will go back to how it was.

00:05:38.530 --> 00:05:39.520
I guess.

00:05:51.080 --> 00:05:56.070
Ginro eat up.
This little scratch on me is nothing.

00:05:56.790 --> 00:05:59.750
Eat up.
I already had my fill.

00:06:00.260 --> 00:06:01.590
You don't need to force
yourself like that...

00:06:01.990 --> 00:06:05.890
I'm fine. You eat it.
I'm already...

00:06:06.400 --> 00:06:10.160
Eat and get better.
Let's go hunting together again.

00:06:10.600 --> 00:06:11.260
What do you say?

00:06:13.470 --> 00:06:15.130
Come on...
You're kidding right?

00:06:16.140 --> 00:06:17.230
Hey. Ginro.

00:06:17.910 --> 00:06:18.570
Ginro!

00:06:19.840 --> 00:06:22.470
Ginro!

00:06:28.520 --> 00:06:32.610
Why?! Why do we have to die
such a pitiful death?

00:06:32.820 --> 00:06:35.350
It's their fault.
They took away our mountain.

00:06:35.460 --> 00:06:36.920
It's the humans' fault!

00:06:46.670 --> 00:06:51.830
I will not die!
Not until I devour all of the humans!

00:06:56.650 --> 00:06:58.840
I'm getting blown away
just from his aura...

00:06:59.650 --> 00:07:02.910
Madarao. I can't defeat him
with my attacks alone.

00:07:03.420 --> 00:07:06.510
I'll act as the decoy to create
an opening for attack.

00:07:07.990 --> 00:07:09.920
I have a plan.

00:07:16.060 --> 00:07:17.160
Will that work?

00:07:17.530 --> 00:07:21.470
Trust me.
He'll come at us head on.

00:07:22.270 --> 00:07:23.740
That's how he is.

00:07:24.570 --> 00:07:27.010
Make sure you can
move at anytime.

00:07:27.780 --> 00:07:31.770
I'll gather my strength
while he's still transforming.

00:07:32.710 --> 00:07:36.170
All right.
I'll go with your plan.

00:07:37.490 --> 00:07:38.280
However...

00:07:39.120 --> 00:07:40.820
I'll be standing in front of you.

00:07:41.760 --> 00:07:42.590
You...

00:07:43.730 --> 00:07:45.420
He'll come at us head on, right?

00:07:45.930 --> 00:07:49.830
Then I'll stop his attacks for
as long as I can.

00:07:50.970 --> 00:07:53.490
If you mess up, you'll die.

00:07:53.800 --> 00:07:56.290
I have no intention of dying.

00:07:56.640 --> 00:07:58.830
And you better not forget
about our promise.

00:08:00.340 --> 00:08:04.780
Do it right. If your attack doesn't work,
I'll never forgive you.

00:08:06.050 --> 00:08:08.020
You sure are dumb.

00:08:08.320 --> 00:08:11.440
Fine. I'll be sure to finish it.

00:08:11.920 --> 00:08:14.910
With my most powerful poison!

00:08:15.460 --> 00:08:16.750
Wow.

00:08:28.170 --> 00:08:30.540
What... is he?

00:08:31.070 --> 00:08:34.800
I became a monster because of
my hatred for humans.

00:08:35.740 --> 00:08:40.770
And yet you...
You became their underling!

00:08:41.150 --> 00:08:43.620
Did you forget, Koya?

00:08:43.820 --> 00:08:45.410
The rule among us mountain dogs.

00:08:46.860 --> 00:08:50.260
We submit to the strong.
That's our rule remember?

00:08:50.630 --> 00:08:52.650
Submitting to the strong?!

00:08:53.190 --> 00:08:55.490
Then I will attain even
more power here!

00:08:55.860 --> 00:08:58.200
Enough so that you
will submit to me!

00:08:58.500 --> 00:09:02.060
And then I will recapture the mountain
that Tokimori sealed!

00:09:04.040 --> 00:09:05.700
The only way I can stop his attack...

00:09:06.140 --> 00:09:07.900
Ginro!

00:09:07.980 --> 00:09:09.070
...is this!

00:09:13.520 --> 00:09:14.500
First!

00:09:16.150 --> 00:09:17.140
Second!

00:09:18.750 --> 00:09:19.740
Third!

00:09:19.890 --> 00:09:21.380
But I was prepared for this!

00:09:25.230 --> 00:09:26.960
All right! I slowed it down!

00:09:27.260 --> 00:09:28.520
Madarao! Do it now!

00:09:40.540 --> 00:09:43.980
Well? My master isn't half bad,
don't you think?

00:09:44.550 --> 00:09:47.810
Serving humans isn't
as bad as you say.

00:10:04.500 --> 00:10:05.160
Koya...

00:10:09.600 --> 00:10:12.400
Your poison has no effect on me.

00:10:13.270 --> 00:10:16.370
Don't make it a half-baked attempt.
Finish the job right and kill me.

00:10:17.780 --> 00:10:18.470
Koya...

00:10:19.910 --> 00:10:20.900
Stop!

00:10:23.280 --> 00:10:27.080
I-I-If you're going to kill our B-Boss,
you'll have to do it over our dead bodies!

00:10:28.260 --> 00:10:29.880
I-Idiots!

00:10:30.990 --> 00:10:33.720
So the ape didn't die.

00:10:34.230 --> 00:10:37.720
I'll give the kid and pheasant
some credit for not running away.

00:10:39.200 --> 00:10:39.860
Boss?

00:10:41.100 --> 00:10:45.840
I'm sick of wandering aimlessly
with you scum.

00:10:46.210 --> 00:10:46.870
Get lost!

00:10:50.150 --> 00:10:52.200
Nagao, Uhosuke. Let's go.

00:10:54.020 --> 00:10:54.910
Are you sure about this?

00:10:57.820 --> 00:11:00.850
It's all right.
This is what Boss wants.

00:11:01.560 --> 00:11:03.790
The Boss' orders must be followed.

00:11:04.890 --> 00:11:07.230
That's the duty of us underlings.

00:11:07.700 --> 00:11:10.220
Why are you so loyal to him?

00:11:10.400 --> 00:11:13.830
Shut up!
Boss is really awesome!

00:11:14.370 --> 00:11:16.100
He's strong... and cool.

00:11:16.940 --> 00:11:19.000
To us. He was the ideal...

00:11:20.780 --> 00:11:21.870
Boss!

00:11:22.210 --> 00:11:26.370
You were the strongest and
best boss that we ever knew!

00:11:26.650 --> 00:11:29.710
Thank you for everything!

00:11:30.890 --> 00:11:34.150
You're all hopeless fools.

00:11:34.890 --> 00:11:36.420
For these past 400 years,

00:11:36.420 --> 00:11:38.590
no matter how much
I abused my underlings,

00:11:38.590 --> 00:11:41.690
you three were the only fools
that stuck with me.

00:11:42.100 --> 00:11:43.220
Get it in your heads.

00:11:43.600 --> 00:11:48.300
Living a boring life is the style
that fits you three best.

00:11:49.040 --> 00:11:50.230
Get out of my face.

00:11:51.310 --> 00:11:53.600
Take care... you guys.

00:11:59.310 --> 00:12:01.010
I'll give him a proper burial.

00:12:01.580 --> 00:12:03.410
Do what the Boss wants.

00:12:03.990 --> 00:12:06.390
But I won't thank you for it.
You are my enemy.

00:12:07.560 --> 00:12:08.680
Boss!

00:12:09.120 --> 00:12:10.420
Idiots!

00:12:12.790 --> 00:12:14.630
Ginro. Do it.

00:12:15.000 --> 00:12:15.660
Koya...

00:12:16.830 --> 00:12:19.230
I used up all my strength...

00:12:19.700 --> 00:12:21.170
There's nothing more I can do.

00:12:21.870 --> 00:12:25.360
Yoshimori, you need to finish him off.

00:12:25.740 --> 00:12:26.730
Please.

00:12:27.310 --> 00:12:28.900
But...

00:12:29.140 --> 00:12:33.340
Wait... Don't give me that... nonsense.

00:12:33.980 --> 00:12:36.610
I refuse to be aided by a human...

00:12:37.290 --> 00:12:39.550
Ginro, you'll have to do it...

00:12:40.420 --> 00:12:41.580
Do it.

00:12:45.590 --> 00:12:48.530
Oh no!
Is he trying to recover?

00:12:49.430 --> 00:12:50.730
No... that's not it!

00:12:51.330 --> 00:12:53.200
Madarao is regaining his powers!

00:12:53.840 --> 00:12:55.430
What's going on?

00:12:56.270 --> 00:13:00.540
It's the power of Karasumori...
Is it telling me to do it?

00:13:05.210 --> 00:13:06.940
All right, Koya.

00:13:07.580 --> 00:13:08.910
This is it!

00:13:15.020 --> 00:13:18.820
Ginro... You win.

00:13:19.330 --> 00:13:21.450
I'm sorry, Koya.

00:13:24.830 --> 00:13:27.170
I injected you with
plenty of anesthetic.

00:13:27.840 --> 00:13:29.740
You will lose consciousness soon.

00:13:30.270 --> 00:13:34.400
Anesthetic...
You're still tame even at the very end.

00:13:34.880 --> 00:13:37.210
And you're still spouting those insults
even at the very end.

00:13:38.550 --> 00:13:41.850
Say, Ginro...
Was I strong?

00:13:42.850 --> 00:13:43.510
Yeah.

00:13:43.990 --> 00:13:48.890
But humans don't go away
no matter how many of them I devour.

00:13:49.760 --> 00:13:52.820
Why? They're all so weak.

00:13:53.800 --> 00:13:55.760
There are many different
kinds of strength...

00:13:56.360 --> 00:13:59.270
But that doesn't change
the fact that you're strong.

00:13:59.900 --> 00:14:02.270
Is that so?
Then I'm satisfied.

00:14:04.740 --> 00:14:07.730
I don't have any
place to go anyway...

00:14:09.540 --> 00:14:10.600
I want to go back...

00:14:12.250 --> 00:14:14.940
I want to go back to that mountain...

00:14:20.520 --> 00:14:21.350
Yoshimori.

00:14:22.520 --> 00:14:23.920
What is this feeling?

00:14:24.860 --> 00:14:26.950
It's as if his death is being hastened.

00:14:28.200 --> 00:14:29.130
Yoshimori...

00:14:30.430 --> 00:14:33.460
When he said he didn't want to die.
He was given power.

00:14:34.570 --> 00:14:37.670
When he said he wanted to die
by Madarao's hand,

00:14:37.670 --> 00:14:39.230
Madarao was given power.

00:14:40.640 --> 00:14:44.480
Is Karasumori reacting
to Koya's desires?

00:14:45.350 --> 00:14:47.080
It's even helping him die.

00:14:47.750 --> 00:14:50.050
That may be another one of
the powers of Karasumori.

00:14:52.250 --> 00:14:58.420
Goodbye, Koya... I liked how
you were always straightforward.

00:15:03.330 --> 00:15:04.990
He's such a fool.

00:15:05.730 --> 00:15:09.860
He could have created
as many homes as he wanted.

00:15:18.410 --> 00:15:20.440
Ketsu! Metsu!

00:15:23.750 --> 00:15:26.020
Madarao, are you all right?

00:15:26.390 --> 00:15:27.220
Yoshimori!

00:15:29.290 --> 00:15:30.350
Hurry it up.

00:15:30.390 --> 00:15:31.480
Hurry what up?

00:15:31.830 --> 00:15:32.720
The seal!

00:15:33.460 --> 00:15:34.550
The seal?

00:15:39.500 --> 00:15:40.990
What's wrong, Madarao?!

00:15:41.570 --> 00:15:43.400
Madarao is also an Ayakashi.

00:15:43.600 --> 00:15:45.800
He's going to transform with
the power of Karasumori?!

00:15:46.040 --> 00:15:49.240
Why that...
His true nature has surfaced...

00:15:49.940 --> 00:15:53.570
When he's like that, he won't recognize
anyone anymore, even Yoshi.

00:16:12.530 --> 00:16:14.230
How do I do the seal?!

00:16:14.340 --> 00:16:16.900
You released the seal
without knowing?!

00:16:16.940 --> 00:16:18.610
Take those beads and
connect them with the Nenshi!

00:16:18.610 --> 00:16:20.700
Then you tie it around Madarao's neck
one more time!

00:16:21.210 --> 00:16:24.840
Is that how to do it?
That's all I know.

00:16:25.150 --> 00:16:28.050
Yes, that's right...
But it's easier said than done.

00:16:28.650 --> 00:16:29.480
Nenshi!

00:16:32.250 --> 00:16:32.910
Ketsu!

00:16:33.550 --> 00:16:35.990
I knew it. It's too difficult for
someone of Yoshi's level.

00:16:36.290 --> 00:16:38.220
Worst case scenario. He'll die.

00:16:38.760 --> 00:16:39.660
You mean Madarao?

00:16:41.100 --> 00:16:42.530
No. Yoshi will.

00:16:44.930 --> 00:16:46.420
Ketsu! Ketsu!

00:16:48.000 --> 00:16:49.490
All right! I caught you!

00:17:03.520 --> 00:17:05.010
Stay down.

00:17:12.890 --> 00:17:13.790
There's more.

00:17:18.170 --> 00:17:19.330
Are you all right, honey?!

00:17:19.430 --> 00:17:20.090
Y-Yes...

00:17:23.470 --> 00:17:24.870
He sounds like he's in pain.

00:17:25.570 --> 00:17:29.700
Well, yeah. The seal is accompanied
by excruciating pain.

00:17:30.110 --> 00:17:31.640
It's going to hurt a lot.

00:17:32.410 --> 00:17:34.380
All right. That's all of them.

00:17:35.520 --> 00:17:36.920
Ready, and...

00:17:39.320 --> 00:17:41.480
That'll do nothing
but prolong Madarao's suffering.

00:17:41.960 --> 00:17:42.850
I can't bear to keep watching.

00:17:44.230 --> 00:17:46.320
Yoshi, loosen your Nenshi!

00:17:46.760 --> 00:17:47.790
L-Like this?

00:17:49.400 --> 00:17:50.990
Here's the last one.

00:17:51.830 --> 00:17:52.890
G-Gotcha!

00:17:53.670 --> 00:17:54.470
Hurry it up!

00:17:54.470 --> 00:17:57.530
Since you loosened the Nenshi,
his body will start emitting poison.

00:17:58.110 --> 00:17:59.130
All right! It's all in.

00:17:59.510 --> 00:18:02.030
Don't loosen it anymore.
Do it all at once.

00:18:02.180 --> 00:18:05.240
You have to tighten it to its original size
and then tie the Nenshi together.

00:18:05.650 --> 00:18:06.580
Tie together?

00:18:06.680 --> 00:18:09.410
You're making a collar out of it!
This is a basic skill!

00:18:09.650 --> 00:18:11.980
H-How do I do that?

00:18:12.420 --> 00:18:16.120
You don't even know that and
you released the seal?

00:18:17.460 --> 00:18:19.120
Stop messing around!

00:18:19.830 --> 00:18:22.490
The seal by itself
causes a lot of pain.

00:18:22.830 --> 00:18:25.360
It'll be fatal if you
take too long with it!

00:18:29.870 --> 00:18:33.240
Hey Grandpa,
something's wrong with Madarao.

00:18:33.270 --> 00:18:34.100
What?!

00:18:36.210 --> 00:18:40.080
That fool!
He released Madarao's seal!

00:18:40.250 --> 00:18:42.840
What? We're not supposed
to release the seal. Ever?

00:18:43.520 --> 00:18:46.510
Shuji-san!
Get me my Kekkaishi attire!

00:18:49.590 --> 00:18:53.150
See? Can't you tell that
he's in a lot of pain?

00:18:54.000 --> 00:18:54.890
You...

00:18:55.760 --> 00:18:58.030
I don't really like him,

00:18:58.030 --> 00:19:02.230
but Master Tokimori did tell
both of us to protect this land.

00:19:02.700 --> 00:19:04.900
Do it right.
You're his master, aren't you?

00:19:05.170 --> 00:19:06.200
I know.

00:19:08.240 --> 00:19:11.470
I'll do it even if it kills me.
That's my duty as his master.

00:19:17.920 --> 00:19:19.050
Listen honey.

00:19:19.420 --> 00:19:23.750
Once Yoshi is ready you need to stop
Madarao's movements for a few moments.

00:19:23.960 --> 00:19:24.980
Will I be able to?

00:19:25.260 --> 00:19:28.390
Then just stop him for an instant.
Just divert Madarao's attention.

00:19:28.700 --> 00:19:31.720
It just needs to be long enough
to match their timing.

00:19:31.930 --> 00:19:33.730
So I just need to create
a chance for them?

00:19:34.840 --> 00:19:37.530
The rest... is all up to them.

00:19:40.540 --> 00:19:42.670
Yoshi, undo your Kekkai.

00:19:42.710 --> 00:19:43.880
What? But...

00:19:43.880 --> 00:19:45.750
At your level,

00:19:45.750 --> 00:19:49.180
you won't be able to maintain a Kekkai
and tie a Nenshi at the same time.

00:19:50.150 --> 00:19:50.810
All right!

00:19:51.490 --> 00:19:52.110
Kai!

00:19:59.630 --> 00:20:01.290
Does it hurt Madarao?

00:20:02.030 --> 00:20:03.960
It's because I'm inexperienced...

00:20:04.070 --> 00:20:04.720
Now!

00:20:05.500 --> 00:20:06.160
Ketsu!

00:20:07.000 --> 00:20:07.660
Metsu!

00:20:09.000 --> 00:20:09.730
All right!

00:20:15.980 --> 00:20:17.000
Now...

00:20:17.480 --> 00:20:18.470
How about this?!

00:20:19.010 --> 00:20:20.340
Connect!

00:20:38.000 --> 00:20:38.990
Madarao!

00:20:39.570 --> 00:20:41.540
I'm so sorry, Madarao.

00:20:41.770 --> 00:20:43.240
Are you all right?!

00:20:45.440 --> 00:20:49.100
P-Please give me some
raw deer meat before I die...

00:20:50.510 --> 00:20:51.880
He looks okay.

00:20:52.510 --> 00:20:54.340
Seems like it went all right.

00:20:55.550 --> 00:20:56.350
Thank you.

00:20:56.980 --> 00:20:57.510
Huh?

00:20:58.390 --> 00:21:02.450
If you didn't stop his movements,
I don't know what would have happened.

00:21:03.120 --> 00:21:04.250
He noticed.

00:21:05.390 --> 00:21:08.520
Nevertheless, you and Madarao
seem all worn out.

00:21:08.830 --> 00:21:09.800
I'm fine.

00:21:11.100 --> 00:21:12.120
But Madarao...

00:21:12.370 --> 00:21:13.560
I told you, didn't I?

00:21:13.800 --> 00:21:16.240
I didn't want you, honey,
to have to deal with the clean up.

00:21:16.770 --> 00:21:17.970
Will the same happen to you?

00:21:18.270 --> 00:21:18.930
Who knows.

00:21:19.310 --> 00:21:21.240
Yoshimori!

00:21:21.510 --> 00:21:25.740
You fool! I know you released
Madarao's seal!

00:21:26.010 --> 00:21:28.000
Oh crap! Gramps is here!

00:21:31.590 --> 00:21:33.680
He reapplied the seal?

00:21:33.950 --> 00:21:36.920
I didn't know he was
powerful enough to do so.

00:21:42.700 --> 00:21:44.860
What is this?!

00:21:45.130 --> 00:21:47.000
As expected from a Sumimura.

00:21:47.130 --> 00:21:50.870
You certainly educated
your Legitimate Heir very well.

00:21:52.370 --> 00:21:55.470
Yoshimori, you fool!

00:21:59.410 --> 00:22:00.400
You two, work right here.

00:22:02.620 --> 00:22:04.140
You must work twice as hard!

00:22:04.220 --> 00:22:06.050
Work until you drop dead!

00:22:06.320 --> 00:22:09.050
He didn't even know how
and yet he released the seal...

00:22:09.520 --> 00:22:10.460
How imprudent.

00:22:10.930 --> 00:22:13.450
You really need to start
planning things ahead of time.

00:22:13.690 --> 00:22:15.180
Seriously, Yoshi.

00:22:17.730 --> 00:22:19.630
But I worked so hard.

00:22:20.170 --> 00:22:22.160
Keep working! Fool!

00:22:23.940 --> 00:22:26.600
So that's my new master...

00:22:27.510 --> 00:22:28.630
I could cry...

00:22:29.840 --> 00:22:33.680
I shouldn't have acknowledged him
as my master.

00:22:38.350 --> 00:22:46.060
The breeze blows past us
in this city we know so well

00:22:46.060 --> 00:22:52.760
The two of us both walk at our usual pace

00:22:54.340 --> 00:23:02.140
Joking around I noticed after I laughed

00:23:02.140 --> 00:23:08.480
Your mature look that
I had never seen before

00:23:10.420 --> 00:23:18.330
You don't have to say anything it's okay

00:23:19.630 --> 00:23:24.690
I'm not mistaking these feelings

00:23:26.270 --> 00:23:33.770
Straight ahead I'm pushing forward

00:23:33.770 --> 00:23:41.310
Yet I can't help but keep gazing at you

00:23:43.050 --> 00:23:50.290
Even if we are near or far

00:23:50.290 --> 00:23:58.860
The red string connects one to another
